  <model metaid="meta_pravastatin_liver_pravastatin" id="pravastatin_liver_pravastatin" name="Model for pravastatin elimination in the liver" substanceUnits="mmole" timeUnits="min" volumeUnits="litre" areaUnits="m2" lengthUnits="metre" extentUnits="mmole">
    <notes>
      <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <h1>Model for pravastatin elimination in the liver</h1>
        <p>Model for hepatic uptake of pravastatin via OATP1B1 (SLCO1B1) and subsequent
excretion in the bile via MRP2 encoded in <a href="http://sbml.org">SBML</a>.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>no metabolism of pravastatin</li>
          <li>irreversible uptake and excretion of pravastatin via the bile into the
intestinal lumen</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The content of this model has been carefully created in a manual research effort.</p>
