    <listOfReactions>
      <reaction sboTerm="SBO:0000655" id="PRAIM" name="pravastatin import (OATP1B1)" reversible="false" compartment="Vbaso">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Import of pravastatin via OATP1B1 (SLCO1B1) from the plasma in the liver.
Here the genetic variants of SLCO1B1 and the inhibition of OATP1B1 have
their effects.</p>
            <p>Irreversible import of pravastatin via Michaelis-Menten kinetics. The
Km of 10 µM is far above the plasma concentrations (0.01-0.5 µM), so
the uptake is linear and Vmax/Km sets the intrinsic clearance; the
hepatic extraction is about 0.5 (F 0.17-0.18 with a fraction absorbed
of 0.34, Singhvi1990).</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <listOfReactants>
          <speciesReference species="pra_ext" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfReactants>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="pra" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <divide/>
              <apply>
                <times/>
                <ci> f_OATP1B1 </ci>
                <ci> PRAIM_Vmax </ci>
                <ci> Vli </ci>
                <ci> pra_ext </ci>
              </apply>
              <apply>
                <plus/>
                <ci> pra_ext </ci>
                <ci> PRAIM_Km_pra </ci>
              </apply>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
      <reaction sboTerm="SBO:0000655" id="PRAEX" name="pravastatin bile export (MRP2)" reversible="false" compartment="Vli">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Export of pravastatin via MRP2 from the liver into the bile, which
flows into the intestinal lumen (enterohepatic circulation). Here the
genetic variants of MRP2 have their effects.</p>
            <p>Irreversible first order export.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <listOfReactants>
          <speciesReference species="pra" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfReactants>
        <listOfProducts>
          <speciesReference species="pra_lumen" stoichiometry="1" constant="true"/>
        </listOfProducts>
        <kineticLaw>
          <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
            <apply>
              <times/>
              <ci> f_MRP2 </ci>
              <ci> PRAEX_k </ci>
              <ci> Vli </ci>
              <ci> pra </ci>
            </apply>
          </math>
        </kineticLaw>
      </reaction>
    </listOfReactions>
